---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  lang="en"
  title="Jiangsu Jiahong Int'l Freight Forwarding · Class I Freight Forwarder"
  description="Jiangsu Jiahong is a Class I licensed freight forwarder offering one-stop import/export services: ocean, air, trucking, warehousing, yards and customs clearance."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero has-img">
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <span class="hero-tag">● Class I Freight Forwarder · One-Stop Import/Export</span>
      <h1>One-Stop Freight Forwarding<br /><span class="hl">Your Gateway to Global Trade</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">Ocean, air, road, warehousing and customs clearance — end-to-end import/export logistics that move your cargo with confidence.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="/en/services" class="btn btn-primary">Explore Services →</a>
        <a href="/en/contact" class="btn btn-ghost">Talk to an Advisor</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div class="stat"><div class="num">12<span class="u">+</span></div><div class="label">Partner Carriers</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="num">20000<span class="u">㎡</span></div><div class="label">Modern Warehouse</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="num">60<span class="u"></span></div><div class="label">Own Trucks</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="num">96.88<span class="u">%</span></div><div class="label">Clearance Rate</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Service scope -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">SERVICE SCOPE</span>
        <h2>Our Services</h2>
        <p>One-stop import/export forwarding across sea, air, road, warehousing and customs clearance.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-3">
        <div class="card reveal">
          <div class="ic">
            <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M3 16V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9l6 6v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2Z"/><path d="M9 8v8M15 8v8M3 12h18"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Ocean Freight</h3>
          <p>Competitive rates on Southeast Asia, Middle East/India, Mediterranean, Europe/US, Red Sea and South America. Contracts with 12 carriers and door-to-door service.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal" data-delay="80">
          <div class="ic">
            <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M2 12l9-7 9 7M4 12v7h16v-7M9 19v-5h6v5"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Air Freight</h3>
          <p>Three consolidation hubs in East/North/South China; core agent for major airlines, ensuring fast global delivery.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal" data-delay="160">
          <div class="ic">
            <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M3 7h11v8H3zM14 10h4l3 3v2h-7z"/><circle cx="7" cy="17" r="2"/><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Domestic Trucking</h3>
          <p>60 own GPS-tracked trucks for import/export containers and LCL, with nationwide door-to-door delivery.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal">
          <div class="ic">
            <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M4 21V8l8-4 8 4v13M4 21h16M9 21v-6h6v6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Warehousing</h3>
          <p>20,000㎡ modern warehouse with 7×24 fine-grained management and value-added services, including a dedicated textile warehouse.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal" data-delay="80">
          <div class="ic">
            <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M3 9h18v10H3zM7 9V6h10v3M9 13h6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Container Yards</h3>
          <p>5 contracted international CYs, 40,000㎡+, 5,000 TEU/day capacity, with professional repair & wash services.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal" data-delay="160">
          <div class="ic">
            <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M12 3l8 4v5c0 5-3.5 8-8 9-4.5-1-8-4-8-9V7l8-4Z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Customs Clearance</h3>
          <p>Professional team tracks every step; 96.88% clearance rate from booking to arrival at port.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Four principles -->
  <section class="section soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">OUR PRINCIPLES</span>
        <h2>Four Service Principles Since Day One</h2>
        <p>Always there · Best service · Best price · Problem-solving.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="philosophy">
        <div class="item reveal">
          <div class="k">Principle 01</div>
          <h4>Always There</h4>
          <p>Quotes whenever you need them, fastest response; issues handled promptly — your on-call logistics partner.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="item reveal" data-delay="80">
          <div class="k">Principle 02</div>
          <h4>Best Service</h4>
          <p>From booking, customs, warehousing to sailing and arrival, we track and report in real time — full visibility, peace of mind.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="item reveal" data-delay="160">
          <div class="k">Principle 03</div>
          <h4>Best Price</h4>
          <p>Contracts with 12 carriers; volume earns our best rates, consistently among the market leaders.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="item reveal" data-delay="240">
          <div class="k">Principle 04</div>
          <h4>Problem-Solving</h4>
          <p>Container shortages and sailings are manageable, inspections coordinated; 96.88% clearance rate. Leave the hard parts to us.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Photo band -->
  <section class="photo-band" style="background-image:url(/images/warehouse.webp)">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">OUR OPERATIONS</span>
      <h2>20,000㎡ Modern Warehouse · 7×24 Operation</h2>
      <p>From storage, stuffing and sorting to labeling and palletizing, Jiahong delivers safe, quality logistics through meticulous operations and full monitoring.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Stats -->
  <section class="section stats-band">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="reveal"><div class="num">40000<span class="u">㎡</span></div><div class="label">Contracted Yard Area</div></div>
        <div class="reveal" data-delay="80"><div class="num">5000<span class="u">TEU</span></div><div class="label">Daily Storage</div></div>
        <div class="reveal" data-delay="160"><div class="num">12<span class="u">+</span></div><div class="label">Carrier Contracts</div></div>
        <div class="reveal" data-delay="240"><div class="num">7×24<span class="u">h</span></div><div class="label">Warehouse Ops</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Testimonial -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">TESTIMONIAL</span>
        <h2>What Clients Say</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="testimonial reveal">
        <blockquote>Jiangsu Jiahong has consistently delivered efficient, reliable logistics for us — truly trustworthy.</blockquote>
        <div class="who"><b>Ali</b> · <span class="role">Client</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How it works -->
  <section class="section soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</span>
        <h2>How It Works</h2>
        <p>A standard, controllable five-step import/export flow from inquiry to delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step reveal"><div class="badge">1</div><h4>Quote</h4><p>Fast response with the best contracted rates.</p></div>
        <div class="step reveal" data-delay="80"><div class="badge">2</div><h4>Booking</h4><p>Booking, container pickup, receiving and documentation.</p></div>
        <div class="step reveal" data-delay="160"><div class="badge">3</div><h4>Customs</h4><p>Professional customs; 96.88% clearance rate.</p></div>
        <div class="step reveal" data-delay="240"><div class="badge">4</div><h4>Tracking</h4><p>From sailing to arrival, full tracking and feedback.</p></div>
        <div class="step reveal" data-delay="320"><div class="badge">5</div><h4>Delivery</h4><p>Destination clearance and delivery, signed off.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="section cta-band">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Ready for Your Global Logistics Plan?</h2>
      <p>Our advisor will tailor a quote and plan for you within one business day.</p>
      <a href="/en/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Contact Us →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
